  caseSubject: My Brother Problem
  caseBody: 'The Case:

    My older brother  lives in the affected area and has
    been distressed. He took this flash picture, and when I saw it, I noticed a very
    faint, pale blur/shape lurking behind him near the closet. I need professional
    analysis to confirm if this thing is responsible for the fear he is experiencing.'
